  "name": "vr-shooter-kit",
  "description": "VR mod デモ (Pistol Whip / Robo Recall / Blade & Sorcery) 共通の触覚 Kit。発砲・被弾・リロード・低体力・BGM 拍・撃破・近接の各イベントを収録",
  "author": "Hapbeat",
  "created_at": "2026-08-05T00:00:00Z",
